#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * High-Speed Turbo Batch Text Translator (Vol 01-24)
 * 
 * Performance Optimizations:
 * - Chunk size increased to 15,000 characters (fewer HTTP roundtrips).
 * - Multi-Worker Concurrency: 6 parallel workers translate chunks simultaneously.
